This definition is not 100% correct. It's possible to have a recursive object or even an array.

```json
{
  "categories": [
    { "value": "", "matchLevel": "none" },
    { "value": "", "matchLevel": "none" }
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "hierarchical": {
    "lvl0": {
      "value": "",
      "matchLevel": "none"
    }
  }
}
```

